<h2 id="overview">1. Overview</h2>

<h3>Current Problem</h3>
<pre>
+------------+  +------------+  +------------+
| Instagram  |  |   TikTok   |  |  Twitter   |
| Account A  |  |  Account B |  |  Account C |
| 100 Friends|  | 50 Friends |  | 200 Friends|
| 500 Photos |  | 30 Videos  |  | 1000 Tweets|
+------------+  +------------+  +------------+
      |               |               |
      +---------------+---------------+
                      |
               [X] Not Connected
               [X] Data Locked
               [X] Friends Isolated
               [X] Privacy Fragmented
</pre>

<h3>WIA-SOCIAL Solution</h3>
<pre>
+-------------------------------------------+
|           WIA-SOCIAL Layer                |
|        "All SNS in One Place"             |
+-------------------------------------------+
|                                           |
|  +-----------------------------------+    |
|  |      Universal Identity           |    |
|  |   My Digital Identity = ONE       |    |
|  +-----------------------------------+    |
|                                           |
|  Instagram &lt;-&gt; TikTok &lt;-&gt; Twitter        |
|       |          |           |            |
|  Threads &lt;-&gt; Bluesky &lt;-&gt; Mastodon        |
|       |          |           |            |
|  Future &lt;-&gt; Future &lt;-&gt; Future            |
|                                           |
|  [OK] Privacy Protected (Aunt Integration)|
+-------------------------------------------+
</pre>

